"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1704,"Narrated to us Yunus ibn 'Abd al-A'la, who said: Ibn Wahb informed us, that Malik informed him, on the authority of Abu az-Zubayr al-Makki, who said: Abu at-Tufayl 'Amir ibn Wathilah informed him, that Mu'adh ibn Jabal informed him that they went out with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) during the year of Tabuk. The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would combine the Zuhr and 'Asr prayers, and the Maghrib and 'Isha' prayers.

He said: ""One day, he delayed the prayer, then came out and prayed Zuhr and 'Asr together, then entered, then came out and prayed Maghrib and 'Isha' together.""

---

**CHAPTER:**"
